        {
          "gap": "Bulk code generation via discountRedeemCodeBulkAdd is asynchronous \u2014 Shopify returns a job ID and processes codes in the background, so completion cannot be confirmed synchronously.",
          "mitigation": "After submitting the bulk creation job, persist the bulkCreationId and poll its status via the Shopify Admin GraphQL discountRedeemCodeBulkCreation query on subsequent admin UI requests. The admin UI shows a 'pending' state and allows the merchant to refresh or re-check status. Export is only enabled once the job reports done=true."
        }
      ],
      "cronBatching": null,
